%description:
An external cell may stand outside the area the nodes move in: a constraint
area describes where things may move, and an external cell's mobility does not
move. Outside any area is where external cells naturally are.

The network holds no node but two external cells, and the ini has the limits
of lib/defaults.ini: **.mobility.constraintArea* with X and Y in 0..1000 m and
Z in 0..0 m, as the example simulations have. Neither cell's position is inside
them: one stands beyond all three upper limits at (1500 m, 1200 m, 25 m), the
other below all three lower limits at (-100 m, -200 m, -5 m). So each of the
six limits, were it to reach the cell's mobility, would be violated on its own.

Checks: the run reaches the time limit, with exit code 0. No traffic is needed:
a mobility out of its constraint area aborts as the network initializes.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: harness.ned
import simu5g.common.binder.Binder;
import simu5g.common.carrierAggregation.CarrierAggregation;
import simu5g.nodes.ExtCell;
import simu5g.stack.phy.medium.CellularRadioMedium;

network Harness
{
    submodules:
        binder: Binder;
        radioMedium: CellularRadioMedium;
        carrierAggregation: CarrierAggregation;
        extCell[2]: ExtCell;
}

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = Harness
sim-time-limit = 10ms
*.binder.printTrafficGeneratorConfig = false
*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 1
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].numBands = 50

*.extCell[0].positionX = 1500m
*.extCell[0].positionY = 1200m
*.extCell[0].positionZ = 25m
*.extCell[1].positionX = -100m
*.extCell[1].positionY = -200m
*.extCell[1].positionZ = -5m
*.extCell[*].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.extCell[*].bandAllocationType = "CONTIGUOUS_ALLOC"
*.extCell[*].bandUtilization = 0.5

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
